-- text --
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
     ┌────────────────────────────── Rsync ───────────────────────────────┐     
     │ Mode:                                                              │     
     │ (*) Update  ( ) Mirror (delete extra)  ( ) Move                    │     
     │                                                                    │     
     │ Destination:                                                       │     
     │ /srv/meadow/                                                       │     
     ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤     
     │ [x] Archive (-a)        [ ] Checksum compare (-c)                  │     
     │ [ ] [i] Decide what changed by comparing file contents (checksums) │     
     │ [ ]     instead of size and modification time. Catches same-size   │     
     │ [ ]     edits but reads every file on both sides, so it is much    │     
     ├────     slower.                                                    ┤     
     │ Exclude:                                                           │     
     │ *.tmp node_modules                                                 │     
     │ Bandwidth limit (KiB/s):                                           │     
     │ 512                                                                │     
     │ Extra arguments:                                                   │     
     │ --hard-links --acls                                                │     
     ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤     
     │ rsync -a /srv/harbor/orchard /srv/meadow/                          │     
     ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤     
     │                         [ OK ]  [ Cancel ]                         │     
     └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘     
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
